inventory Plugin for DokuWiki

Integrating with spookie invetory

All documentation for this plugin can be found at
https://github.com/spo0okie/doku_inventory

Assets (CSS/JS) are synced from the ARMS repository:
  ./sync_assets.sh [path_to_arms]   # default ../arms
style.css is GENERATED (arms css files + style.local.css) - edit
style.local.css for plugin-local rules/overrides, never style.css.
tooltipster.bundle.js carries ARMS LOCAL PATCHes (tooltip sizing fixes)
required by qtip_ajax.js - always update them together via sync_assets.sh.

If you install this plugin manually, make sure it is installed in
lib/plugins/inventory/ - if the folder is called different it
will not work!

Please refer to http://www.dokuwiki.org/plugins for additional info
on how to install plugins in DokuWiki.

